@SegmentationApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5045

### All products
GET {{SegmentationApi_HostAddress}}/api/products
Accept: application/json

### Products of one category
GET {{SegmentationApi_HostAddress}}/api/products?category=COMPUTER_DRIVE_OR_STORAGE
Accept: application/json

### Top 2 features for a tablet
POST {{SegmentationApi_HostAddress}}/api/recommendations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "gender": "Female",
  "age": 30,
  "income": "From25kTo49k",
  "asin": "B07FKR6KXF",
  "topN": 2
}

### Product from the DRIVE_OR_STORAGE sheet (category COMPUTER_DRIVE_OR_STORAGE)
POST {{SegmentationApi_HostAddress}}/api/recommendations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "gender": "Male",
  "age": 42,
  "income": "From100kTo149k",
  "asin": "B07CRG94G3",
  "topN": 2
}

### Validation errors: age < 18, topN > 2
POST {{SegmentationApi_HostAddress}}/api/recommendations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "gender": "Male",
  "age": 16,
  "income": "LessThan25k",
  "asin": "B07CRG94G3",
  "topN": 3
}

### Unknown ASIN
POST {{SegmentationApi_HostAddress}}/api/recommendations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "gender": "Other",
  "age": 70,
  "income": "From150kOrMore",
  "asin": "NOPE",
  "topN": 1
}
